      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STELLA SWIFT (7) recorded a 2 length third in a TG1-4W last time 20.09 at this track and trip and also jumping from the same draw. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Tough to beat on best. BEE LINE BUZZ (8) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when second (20.17) in a TG1-4W at this track. Expected to feature again. TOUGH COOKIE (5) finished second (20.27) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has good early speed so he should be prominent despite the squeeze draw. Has ability and can measure up. ROCK ON BUB (1) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
